start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {9dc}@ring ss@top
R2: 2ch=dc dc@same [2dc@st]x9 ss@top
R3: 2ch=dc dc@same [dc 2dc@st]x9 dc ss@top
R4: 2ch=dc dc@same [2dc 2dc@st]x9 2dc ss@top fo
R5: {dc 2ch 2dc}@st [dc hdc 5sc hdc dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@st]x3 dc hdc 5sc hdc dc ss@top
R6: ch hdc@same [{2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner [hdc]>corner]x3 {2hdc 2ch 2hdc}@corner [hdc]>end ss@top
R7: ch sc@same [{sc 2ch sc}@corner [sc]>corner]x3 {sc 2ch sc}@corner [sc]>end ss@top fo
